2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in Oviedo, where he spent his early life in the court of Alfonso II. He was probably associated with the crown from an early age.
2 CONT
2 CONT When just nine years old, he moved to Lugo, capital of the province of Galicia, of which his father, Ramiro, had been named governor. There he was educated, including in the military arts.
