2 CONT to a son, they
2 CONT had two daughters, Osicia and Divigria, the latter
2 CONT married to an
2 CONT Aquilo. This couple had, with several others, two
2 CONT sons, Fafila and
2 CONT Diego, who married his first cousin Gulvira, daughter
2 CONT of Osicia, and had
2 CONT a son Pedro (again, with others)."
