2 CONT
2 CONT      Ildonca Menéndez was born circa 880. She was the daughter of conde Hermenegildo Gutiérrez and Hermesenda Gatónez. Ildonca Menéndez married Gutierre Osoriz of Galicia, son of Osorio Gutiérrez, before 902. Ildonca Menéndez died
2 CONC  in 942.
