1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''García Iñiguez'''
2 CONT King of Pamplona
2 CONT Reign	851-2 – 870
2 CONT Predecessor	Íñigo Arista
2 CONT Successor	Fortún Garcés
2 CONT Born	c. 810
2 CONT Burial	Monastery of Leyre
