2 CONT -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/Galicia.htm#EroFernandezA
2 CONT
2 CONT ''The link between the three supposed brothers Diego, Ero and Godesteo Fernández is speculative.  Ero Fernández was an important figure during the reigns of Ordoño II and Alfonso IV Kings of León and was created conde, based at Lu
2 CONC go in central Galicia. ''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *1.         FERNANDO ---, son of ---.  m ---.  The name of Fernando´s wife is not known.  Fernando & his wife had [three children:]
2 CONT
2 CONT **a)         [DIEGO Fernández .  909 926.]   -        see below. 
2 CONT
2 CONT **b)      '''   [ERO Fernández''' (-after 24 Sep 926, bur Santa María de Ferreira de Pallares).  Conde.]    -        see below. 
