1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not a known son of https://www.geni.com/people/Recaredo-I-rey-de-los-visigodos/6000000003983656890?through=6000000186972157845
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a Visigothic Prince of the early 7th century AD. and offspring of King Recáredo I and one of his several affective connections, in this case, born to the Merovingian princess Clodesind (also called Chodoswintha of Austrasia
2 CONC  (daughter of King Sigebert I). Benedicto was lord of the fief of Liebana, in northern Spain in the surroundings of Cantabria and on the shores of the Bay of Biscay.His descent is partly intertwined with European and New World nob
2 CONC ility.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT "The cartulary of Liebana includes an
2 CONT undated, but certainly
2 CONT early, document which provides details realting to the
2 CONT descendants of a
2 CONT certain Benedicto and his wife Ellesinda. In addition
2 CONT to a son, they
2 CONT had two daughters, Osicia and Divigria, the latter
2 CONT married to an
2 CONT Aquilo. This couple had, with several others, two
2 CONT sons, Fafila and
2 CONT Diego, who married his first cousin Gulvira, daughter
2 CONT of Osicia, and had
2 CONT a son Pedro (again, with others)."
2 CONT
2 CONT https://groups.google.com/g/soc.genealogy.medieval/c/C2DndlSATAc
2 CONT
