2 CONT * 1.         [LAIN Núñez (-after 1063).  The "Corónicas" Navarras name "Layn Nunyz" as the son of "Nuyno Laniz" and his wife[378].  The Historia Roderici names Laín Núñez as son of “Nuño Laínez…[and] Eylo”[379].  The Nobiliario of
2 CONC  Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "Lain Nuñez" as the son of "Nuño Lainez" and his wife[380].  He subscribed charters of Fernando I King of Castile between 1049 and 1063[381].]  m ---.  '''The name of Lain's wife is not known.'''  La
2 CONC in & his wife had [two] children:
2 CONT ** a)         '''DIEGO Laínez''' (-[1058]).  … He captured the castles of Ubierna, Urbel and La Piedra from Navarre, probably after 1054[386].  m TERESA Rodríguez, daughter of RODRIGO Álvarez & his wife Teresa Núñez. Diego & his w
2 CONC ife had [three] children: 
2 CONT ***i)          [daughter .  If "sobrinis" can be interpreted as nephew in the charter dated below, the mother of Álvaro Yáñez was the sister of Rodrigo Díaz.  If that is correct, the chronology suggests that she must have been his
2 CONC  older sister.]  m JUAN ---, son of ---.  One child
2 CONT **** (a)       ÁLVARO Yáñez 
2 CONT *** ii)         [daughter .  If "sobrinis" can be interpreted as nephew in the charter dated below, the mother of Álvaro Alvárez was the sister of Rodrigo Díaz.  If that is correct, the chronology suggests that she must have been 
2 CONC his older sister.]  m ÁLVARO ---, son of ---.  One child: 
2 CONT **** (a)       ÁLVARO Alvárez (-after 19 Jul 1074).
2 CONT *** iii)        '''RODRIGO Díaz de Vivar''' (Vivar near Burgos [1043]-Valencia [10] Jul 1099, bur monastery of San Pedro de Cardeña) [EL CID] .  …  The Chronicon Burgense records the death in 1099 of “Rodericus Campidoctor”[401]. 
2 CONC  m ([19 Jul] 1074) JIMENA Díaz, daughter of conde DIEGO Fernández & his second wife Cristina Fernández (-1106).  Rodrigo & his wife had three children: 
2 CONT ** b)   ['''FERNANDO Laínez''' .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Diego Lainez, D. Fernando Lainez" as the children of "Lain Nuñez"[415].]  m '''JIMENA Núñez, daughter of NUÑO Alfonso de Amaya & his wife ---'''
2 CONC .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Enxamea Nuñez, D. Teresa Nñez" as the children of "D. Nuño Alvarez de Maya", illegitimate son of Alfonso V King of León, and his wife, and in a later passage records that "D. 
2 CONC Fernando Lainez" married "D. Ximena Nuñez"[416].  ''Fernando & his wife had one child:'' 
2 CONT ***i)          [Alvaro Fernández Minaya .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "Conde D. Alvaro Fernandez Minaya, que tuvo del Rey en tenencia a Castroxerez" as the child of "D. Fernando Lainez" and his wife "D. Ximena
2 CONC  Nuñez"[417].]  m [MILIA Ansúrez, daughter of Conde PEDRO Ansúrez & his second wife Eilo Alfonso.  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos records that "Conde D. Alvaro Fernandez Minaya, que tuvo del Rey en tenencia a Castroxere
2 CONC z" married "D. la Condesa D. Milia Anzores, hija del Conde Don Pedro Anzores de Caton"[418].]  Álvaro & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT ****(a)       MARÍA Álvarez .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Maria Alvarez" as the child of "Conde D. Alvaro Fernandez Minaya, que tuvo del Rey en tenencia a Castroxerez" and his wife "D. la Condesa D. Milia 
2 CONC Anzores, hija del Conde Don Pedro Anzores de Caton"[419]. 
