1 NOTE 55448864. Kong Sancho II. Abarca GARCIASON i Narvarra was a Konge in 970 in Narvarra. (7305) He died in 994.(7306) He was a Greve in Aragonien.(7307) Grevskapet ervervet han ved sitt ekteskap He was married to Grevinne Urraca FERN
