2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard I, conde de Ribagorza y Pallars1
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 885, d. after 950
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Ramón I, conde Ribagorza y Pallars2 b. circa 855?, d. circa 916
2 CONT
