1 NOTE Infanta de León
1 NOTE Infanta de León
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT www.dcs.hull.ac.uk/cgi-bin/gedlkup/n=royal?royal10135
1 NOTE She was bethrothed to Garcia II Sanchez de Castile. On the way to the church, San Juan Bautista, where he was to marry her he was assassinated.
2 CONT She was later forced to marry, Fernando I El Magno.
1 NOTE Sancha of León (1013 - 27 November 1067) was a daughter of Alfonso V of Leon by Elvira Mendes and Queen consort of Castile. She married Ferdinand I of León in 1032. She was a devout Catholic.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT She had five children:
2 CONT Urraca of Zamora, Infanta of León. Ruler of the city Zamora. 
2 CONT Sancho II of Castile (1040s - 1067). First son. 
2 CONT Elvira of Toro, Infanta of León. Ruler of the city Toro. 
2 CONT Alfonso VI of León (1040s - July 1, 1109). Second son. 
2 CONT García II of Galicia and Portugal (1040s - 1090s). Third son.  
1 NOTE "OF LEON"
1 NOTE 867789477. Dronning Sancha (Beata) ALFONSDTR av Leon og Kastiljen (20631) was born in 1016. She died on 13 Dec 1071.(20632) She was a Dronning in Leon og Kastiljen.(20633) Hennes foreldr lot henne ekte infanten don Carcia, men på
2 CONC  selve bryllupsdagen ble denne drept av misfordøyde adelsmenn. De spanske kronister roser henne meget for hennes dyder, klokskap, redelighet og rettferdighet og for hennes kjerlighet til sine udersåtter. Da hun påny ble enke, tr
2 CONC ekk hun seg tilbake til klostret San Isidro i Leon og føte her et ærbart liv til sin død.
