2 CONT * Mira la SUEVA  m. Sigebut BALTHES (King) of the VISIGOTHS   ;   Sisebut (King) of the VISIGOTHS [alt ped] Child:       Theodora the VISIGOTH [alt ped]
2 CONT * (NN) of GALICIA Prince of SUEVI m. ? Child:       Ariomiro (II; Sn.) de DEZA
