2 CONC ueen Isabel who he married in succession to the first). Zaida/Isabel died in childbirth, but the date is unknown, and it is unclear whether the child being delivered was Sancho, an additional illegitimate child, otherwise unknown,
2 CONC  or legitimate daughter Elvira (if Zaida was identical to Queen Isabel).
