1 OCCU VIII Señor de Vizcaya, 3er Seños de Vizcaya, Señor de Vizcaya, Fue tercer señor de Vizcaya entre los años 1093 y 1124., Señor de Alava, Guipúzcoa y Nájera, VIII Señor Soberano de Vizcaya, de Alva, Nájera y Haro
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Diego López I de Haro''' died 1124-1126
2 CONT
2 CONT Third Lord of Biscay, and also ruler of Álava, Buradón, Grañón, Nájera, Haro, and perhaps Guipúzcoa.
2 CONT
2 CONT The most powerful Castilian magnate in the Basque Country and the Rioja during the first quarter of the twelfth century. He was a loyal supporter of Queen Urraca and he fought the invading armies of her estranged husband Alfonso t
2 CONC he Battler on two, or perhaps three, occasions.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/VIZCAYA.htm#LopeIniguezdied1093B FMG MedLands Vizcaya]
2 CONT
