1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Teresa Garcia de Toledo=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Diego Garcia de Toledo and María Gudie
2 CONT * Daughter of Diego García de Toledo, his father's companion, also private and ambassador of Fernando IV and mayor of Toledo; had a numerous offspring. Her sons were Diego Gómez de Toledo, senior notary of the Kingdom of Toledo an
2 CONC d mayor of the city; Pedro Suárez de Toledo el Mozo , pastry chef to King Pedro I; Gutierre Gómez de Toledo, prior of the Order of San Juan and master of Alcántara, and Suer Gómez de Toledo, archbishop of Compostela.
2 CONT * Birth: 1312, Of, Toledo, New Castile, Spain Juan Perez De_Toledo 
2 CONT * [https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p888.htm '''Our Royal, Titled, Noble, and Commoner Ancestors & Cousins''']
2 CONT * [http://www.thepeerage.com/p21205.htm '''The Peerage''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Gómez Pérez de Toledo, II,''' son of Fernán Gómez de Toledo, Camarero Mayor del Rey and Teresa Vázquez de Acuña, Señora de Villaverde. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''D. Diego Gómez de Toledo, I señor de Casarrubios y Valdepusa;''' Senior notary of the Kingdom of Toledo and mayor of the city.
2 CONT * '''Gutierre Gómez, maestre de Alcántara;''' Prior of the Order of San Juan and master of Alcántara.
2 CONT * '''Pedro Suárez de Toledo el Mozo''' Pastry chef to King Pedro I
2 CONT * '''Suer Gómez de Toledo,''' archbishop of Compostela.
2 CONT * '''Teresa Vázquez,''' married to García Fernández Manrique
