2 CONT
2 CONT Grassotti, H. "Homenaje de García Ramírez a Alfonso VII." Príncipe de Viana. 94–95 (1964).
2 CONT
2 CONT Norwich, John Julius. The Kingdom in the Sun, 1130–1194. London: Longmans, 1970.
