2 CONT "....Fernão Pires Tinhoso (born around 1060 in Portugal) was a historical figure of the Portuguese medieval nobility, son of Martim Soares Fafes. Genealogical records indicate that he lived during the period of the Christian Recon
2 CONC quista, and was the father of at least one daughter, Senhora Pires Tinhoso....'
